---
config:
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: false
    actorMargin: 30
    messageMargin: 24
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Controls
    participant API as Replay API
    participant Replay as Replay
    participant CSV as Dataset
    participant Predict as Prediction

    Admin->>UI: Select scenario and limits
    UI->>API: POST /replay/start
    API->>Replay: Validate controls and count rows
    Replay->>CSV: Scan bounded selection
    alt invalid request or unavailable dataset
        Replay-->>API: Validation failure
        API-->>UI: 409 or 422 response
    else replay accepted
        API-)Replay: Start background task
        API-->>UI: 202 Running
    end

    par background replay
        loop each selected row
            Replay->>CSV: Read next row lazily
            CSV-->>Replay: Canonical observation
            Replay->>Predict: Process observation
            Predict-->>Replay: Persisted prediction
        end
    and status and control
        loop while view is active
            UI->>API: GET /replay/status
            API-->>UI: Current ReplayStatus
        end
        opt operator control
            UI->>API: Pause, resume, or stop
            API->>Replay: Update serialized control state
            API-->>UI: Updated ReplayStatus
        end
    end

    note over Replay,Predict: Prediction details are defined in diagram 07.
